  "description": "Sa-Ra, a high school senior who failed her exams, starts receiving tutoring from Seo-Won, her older brother's friend. Sa-ra becomes fascinated by Seo-Won, a student at a prestigious university with incredible social skills, but feels frustrated that he likely sees her as just a kid...\n\nA high school senior's unrequited love story, filled with hesitation and anxiety as she struggles to approach the tutor she admires. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
